                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "听歌……咩？\n{A笑眯眯}好呐好呐，让我好好准备……\n露出耳朵，然后蓬~松松，听起来！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1999990036_1583453612_content",
                "value": "听歌……咩？\n{A笑眯眯}好呐好呐，让我好好准备……\n露出耳朵，然后蓬~松松，听起来！",
